      | AVAILABLE TOOLS:
      | Tool: search_tool
      | Description: Looks a topic up in an encyclopedia.
      | Parameters: {"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"]}
      |
      | Tool: read_file
      | Description: Reads a file from the agent workspace.
      | Parameters: {"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"}},"required":["path"]}
      |
      | Tool: write_file
      | Description: Writes a file in the agent workspace.
      | Parameters: {"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"content":{"type":"string"}},"required":["path","content"]}
      |
      | Tool: append_file
      | Description: Appends to a file in the agent workspace.
      | Parameters: {"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"content":{"type":"string"}},"required":["path","content"]}
      |
      | Tool: delete_file
      | Description: Deletes a file from the agent workspace.
